                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": 760,
                          "content": "Three rows of 3 px round dots, 3 px apart (16 to 20 columns). The head moves one column every 60 ms: two columns on the bottom row, four on the middle, then it cruises along the top, which is the logo's 15° climb. After the last column it pauses four steps and takes off again. The strip sits 6 px above the frame's top-left corner, where the frame name would be.",
